# Static files in this directory take precedence over the SPA fallback.
/robots.txt /robots.txt 200
/sitemap.xml /sitemap.xml 200
/favicon.png /favicon.png 200
/favicon.ico /favicon.ico 200
/og-image.png /og-image.png 200

# Expo SPA shell. Unknown paths (and missing files not listed above) are a
# soft-404: HTTP 200 + index.html. A top-level 404.html would disable
# Cloudflare Pages' implicit SPA matching and still would not fire while this
# splat is present. True HTTP 404 needs Pages Functions or dropping /*.
/* /index.html 200
